  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right; MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt;\" align=right><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black;\">清科通<SPAN>[2026]170</SPAN>号<SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt;\" align=center><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体;\"> </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt;\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体;\">根据《清华大学深圳国际研究生院人工智能专项项目管理办法》等有关规定，经深圳<SPAN>-</SPAN>清华人工智能基础前沿研究专项委员会审议，拟对深圳<SPAN>-</SPAN>清华人工智能基础前沿研究专项第三批定向项目予以资助，现公示如下：<SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt;\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体;\"> </SPAN></P>\r\n<DIV align=center>\r\n<TABLE class=MsoTableGrid style=\"BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; WIDTH: 123.22%; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none;\" cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=\"123%\" border=1>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR style=\"HEIGHT: 22.55pt;\">\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 22.55pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 8.44%; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt;\" align=center><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体;\">序号<SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 22.55pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 44.3%; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent;\" width=\"44%\">\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt;\" align=center><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体;\">项目名称</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体;\"></SPAN></P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 22.55pt; BORD